<section class="summary">
  <h2>Lead Engineer — Web Platform &amp; AI-Augmented Development</h2>
  <p>
    Engineering lead with 15+ years of deep, hands-on web-platform expertise — HTML, CSS,
    JavaScript/TypeScript, web components, browser APIs, performance, and the architecture
    and design systems that hold large front ends together. As Development Lead at Spectra
    Media Collective I own the product's re-architecture and its AWS infrastructure, and
    I'm building AI-assisted interfaces over a large data catalogue.
  </p>
  <p>
    I pair that platform depth with AI-augmented development — deep platform knowledge is
    what turns AI coding from a shortcut into real leverage. My best work is composable,
    testable systems, plus the developer experience and mentoring that keep teams fast.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="skills">
  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul class="skills-list">
    <li>Web platform: HTML, CSS, SCSS, SVG, Web Components, Lit, Stencil.js, accessibility (a11y/WCAG), performance</li>
    <li>Frameworks &amp; architecture: React, Next.js, Astro, Node.js, SSR/SSG, island architecture, JAM stack, design systems, design tokens</li>
    <li>AI-assisted product interfaces &amp; AI-augmented development; working with AI coding tools and agents</li>
    <li>Languages: JavaScript, TypeScript, C#, shell scripting, functional programming — a polyglot's comfort picking up new languages and stacks quickly</li>
    <li>Cloud &amp; delivery: AWS (Lambda, S3, EC2, Elastic Beanstalk, Amplify, Cognito), microservices, build &amp; deployment automation</li>
    <li>TDD, Jest, Playwright, Puppeteer, automation; code review, mentorship, Agile/Scrum, DX</li>
  </ul>
</section>

